(
    title: "Combat Two",
    description: Some("Atari\'s unreleased sequel to its launch-title Combat trades the single arena for a landscape of forests, rivers and bridges: tanks carry three layers of armour, bases lob cruise missiles, water bogs you down and treelines hide you, with a level designer on the cart. The shift from fast grudge-match to slow two-player strategy — with no computer opponent — is what killed it; the GCC-built prototype reached late work-in-progress before cancellation."),
